name: Read one real model lesson draft with exhausted allowance and no automatic acceptance
size: 120x36
# Owned unversioned fixture. The receipt helper authenticates source and state;
# this reader makes no Git HEAD continuity claim.
cwd: @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_lesson_receipts.py @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target @ART before
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign live-owned-lesson-20261026
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | completed-real-lesson
expect: findings:lesson-generate · completed
expect: 1 total attempt · cost unknown
expect-not: L resume
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 new approved plan | completed-work-refusal
ask: Does the completed real lesson retain one consumed job and unknown cost while refusing another launch without a new approved plan?
keys: r a
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATED LESSON DRAFT | generated-result
expect: Inspect model-proposed lesson
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Draft · Treat review labels | model-draft
expect: gpt-6-luna
expect: Captured historical source supplied.
expect: Evidence text: 2572 B
resize: 160x48
live-snap: draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Draft | draft-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Captured historical source | historical-source-40x12
ask: Across six sizes and compact paging, is the actual lesson visibly a draft with its model, historical source receipt and limits, without accepting it or changing the finding verdict?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 Draft · Treat review labels | restored-draft
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_lesson_receipts.py @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target @ART after-reading
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target/../home NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign live-owned-lesson-20261026
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | recovered-job
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATED LESSON DRAFT | recovered-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Draft · Treat review labels | recovered-draft
expect: gpt-6-luna
expect: Captured historical source supplied.
expect: current source was not read
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the same draft revision, source limitations and single settled real request without new work or automatic acceptance?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_lesson_receipts.py @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/live-lesson-prepared-20261026/target @ART restarted
